{"lines":[{"x":0.80023056686818617,"t":"Reading","y":0.066954971807407837,"w":0.080059057871500694,"c":1,"h":0.017371263031182749},{"x":0.061964271969209887,"y":0.11478821686461049,"w":0.81786900838216159,"c":1,"t":"Later, a Travel Planner feature was added, which allowed visitors to click and 'bookmark'","h":0.023408738705548493},{"x":0.062030086012594361,"w":0.78571426391601562,"y":0.13650998038002893,"h":0.017707662588538287,"t":"places or attractions they were interested in, and then view the results on a map. The","c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Travel Planner offered suggested routes and public transport options between the","x":0.062030069546132723,"y":0.15550547300392803,"h":0.017459643401411928,"w":0.75375940958658849},{"y":0.17441860452009816,"x":0.062030076063436849,"w":0.78383458455403654,"h":0.017468066194022192,"c":1,"t":"chosen locations. There were also links to accommodation in the area. By registering"},{"y":0.19186046501901022,"w":0.78759394327799481,"x":0.062030094925852285,"h":0.020348836895119127,"t":"with the website, users could save their Travel Plan and return to it later, or print it out","c":1},{"y":0.20928102875304133,"t":"to take on the visit. The website also had a 'Your Words' section where anyone could","x":0.061969969963409616,"h":0.02065863182524752,"w":0.78020100911458334,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.062030081769850656,"y":0.23110465103084121,"t":"submit a blog of their New Zealand travels for possible inclusion on the website.","w":0.73684209187825511,"h":0.017446540051403225},{"y":0.27906976731116706,"w":0.76315790812174478,"c":1,"h":0.01745309172640741,"x":0.062030068401766794,"t":"The Tourism New Zealand website won two Webby awards for online achievement"},{"y":0.29781068921383069,"x":0.062030086010880912,"c":1,"t":"and innovation. More importantly perhaps, the growth of tourism to New Zealand was","w":0.78571426391601562,"h":0.019049775884447784},{"t":"impressive. Overall tourism expenditure increased by an average of 6.9% per year","x":0.063909773351469426,"w":0.75939849853515629,"y":0.31680618169062935,"h":0.017496144011645565,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.01904135309183741,"x":0.062030082584685051,"w":0.81390975952148437,"t":"between 1999 and 2004. From Britain, visits to New Zealand grew at an average annual","y":0.33575581396479848},{"c":1,"y":0.35465116294041654,"x":0.060150371501089997,"h":0.020429326270521631,"t":"rate of 13% between 2002 and 2006, compared to a rate of 4% overall for British","w":0.74436091105143221},{"c":1,"w":0.12593985239664712,"t":"visits abroad.","x":0.062030073727688283,"h":0.015988372635703185,"y":0.3749999997116511},{"x":0.062030063968827751,"h":0.017511119093345351,"y":0.42144236937497737,"w":0.75751881917317709,"c":1,"t":"The website was set up to allow both individuals and travel organisations to create"},{"h":0.020833248180185504,"c":1,"x":0.061982913403208689,"w":0.78020207722981771,"t":"itineraries and travel packages to suit their own needs and interests. On the website,","y":0.43849757638882259},{"y":0.45930232535948456,"h":0.018895348808647183,"t":"visitors can search for activities not solely by geographical location, but also by the","x":0.060150399753901337,"c":1,"w":0.76315785725911456},{"x":0.062030067084775646,"w":0.81578948974609389,"t":"particular nature of the activity. This is important as research shows that activities are the","c":1,"y":0.47965116265954932,"h":0.017451219994716327},{"x":0.062030075325704391,"w":0.79323308308919271,"y":0.49839021259850447,"t":"key driver of visitor satisfaction, contributing 74% to visitor satisfaction, while transport","h":0.019051647616138978,"c":1},{"y":0.51738570531262118,"t":"and accommodation account for the remaining 26%. The more activities that visitors","w":0.77443608601888025,"c":1,"x":0.062030077216970007,"h":0.017498015743336648},{"h":0.020274205278444479,"t":"undertake, the more satisfied they will be. It has also been found that visitors enjoy","c":1,"y":0.53517778806865346,"w":0.76137278238932293,"x":0.061978399238003683},{"t":"cultural activities most when they are interactive, such as visiting a marae (meeting","w":0.76315790812174489,"y":0.5552325581509443,"h":0.018895348808647183,"c":1,"x":0.062030068416674071},{"y":0.57558139507530703,"x":0.06015037145543535,"c":1,"t":"ground) to learn about traditional Maori life. Many long-haul travellers enjoy such","w":0.74436091105143232,"h":0.015988372635703185},{"h":0.022783608568612834,"y":0.59013552777947109,"w":0.79534896850585934,"c":1,"x":0.063796018168470706,"t":"earning experiences, which provide them with stories to take home to their friends and"},{"h":0.019893285158136487,"t":"tamily. In addition, it appears that visitors to New Zealand don't want to be 'one of the","y":0.61135664373172882,"w":0.78394063313802076,"x":0.06010017499050832,"c":1},{"x":0.062030076055110135,"w":0.78383458455403643,"t":"crowd and find activities that involve only a few people more special and meaningful.","h":0.015988372635703185,"c":1,"y":0.63226744158707537},{"y":0.67868641321901346,"w":0.81390975952148448,"h":0.017534516967655511,"c":1,"x":0.060150380521212791,"t":"It could be argued that New Zealand is not a typical destination. New Zealand is a small"},{"c":1,"y":0.69767441887218362,"h":0.017441859494004897,"x":0.060150387253778866,"w":0.77067667643229165,"t":"country with a visitor economy composed mainly of small businesses. It is generally"},{"t":"perceived as a safe English-speaking country with a reliable transport infrastructure.","w":0.77631576538085934,"h":0.016097875080489321,"c":1,"y":0.71796522878721492,"x":0.060150387888385996},{"t":"Because of the long-haul flight, most visitors stay for longer (average 20 days) and want","y":0.7369186043779723,"w":0.81203008015950529,"c":1,"h":0.016139992113966994,"x":0.062030072608217308},{"x":0.060150380067285597,"t":"to see as much of the country as possible on what is often seen as a once-in-a-lifetime","y":0.75581395321466704,"h":0.015988372635703185,"w":0.7988721720377604,"c":1},{"t":"visit. However, the underlying lessons apply anywhere - the effectiveness of a strong","w":0.78392852783203126,"x":0.060100353880370959,"y":0.77277702103974555,"c":1,"h":0.019683445490181861},{"t":"brand, a strategy based on unique experiences and a comprehensive and user-friendly","x":0.060103340226552102,"w":0.80272252400716149,"y":0.79096470178284883,"c":1,"h":0.020433476258306715},{"w":0.081336695353190103,"h":0.016125227663490893,"c":1,"y":0.81189273771052561,"x":0.05994232270391147,"t":"website."}],"w":2400,"h":3106}